WEBVTT

00:00:57.716 --> 00:01:00.676
even as others refused to believe
what we told them:

00:01:01.316 --> 00:01:03.436
that the planet’s climate is changing.

00:01:04.876 --> 00:01:07.196
Our story has heroes big and small.

00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:09.916
Maybe you even became a hero
in your own way.

00:01:10.476 --> 00:01:14.276
It's a story of hope, persistence,
a plan for a better future.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:19.356
There's also despair,
denial and relentless crises.

00:01:19.956 --> 00:01:23.276
While there are forces
that seek to divide or distract us,

00:01:23.276 --> 00:01:25.356
we choose to act -- now.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:27.996
The story has many possibilities.

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:30.796
Futures that we write first as neighbors